      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>Alice Lucas’s rhymed paraliturgical translation of the piyyut “Yom Zeh l’Yisrael” by Rabbi Yitsḥaq Luria, was first published in her <tei:hi rend="italic">The Jewish Year</tei:hi> (1898), pp. 180-181, under the title “Grace for the Sabbath.” Several of the stanzas are omitted in her translation. –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
